  message: "Fixed in PR 1749 (dev f9240ffd78). spec_validator._check_confidence_range skips confidence_source=corroborated. BEHAVIORAL, production path: a fresh scip-python-enabled self-map of merged dev (HYPERGUMBO_SCIP_PYTHON=1, NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=9000; 8m47s, summed tree peak 10.3 GB): scripts/check-self-tree-validation -> 'self-tree violation matrix: {}', 'OK: self-tree validation within baselines.', exit 0. Before the fix the same build gave exit 1, 'cross_field|info: 109622 > baseline 0'. Unit: test_confidence_range_skips_a_corroborated_edge (a non-corroborated 0.95 ast_call_direct edge is still flagged)."  # b472
